        <mxCell id="footnote" value="&lt;b&gt;Hybrid:&lt;/b&gt; query text + embedding.  &lt;b&gt;Exact:&lt;/b&gt; direct key lookup without the model.&lt;br&gt;The endpoint and vector index are each shown twice for clarity. Dashed lines are conditional or asynchronous; red marks an ingest failure." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=19;fontColor=#435D7C;" vertex="1" parent="1">
